source: captured 2026-11-21 for 2.1.4: Claude Code 2.1.329 (the version on laptop2, installed from npm) run in a throwaway container on laptop under tmux at 134x48, against a local mock of the Messages API whose reply to "run-main" was a Bash call (gh api repos/O/R/actions/runs/1/artifacts ...), with a PreToolUse hook that answers "ask" with the reason "gh policy: shared gh policy unavailable", as Bill's shared gh policy hook does; tmux capture-pane. Every row is as Claude drew it (real); the command, repo and reason are the mock's (neutral). No live pane was read. A hook's "ask" offers only Yes and No.
